Cloudflare WARP Config Generator (Warp-Masque free)

An independent implementation inspired by:

  https://github.com/byJoey/warp-masque-actions
  https://m2c.pages.dev/
  https://masque.pages.dev/

Instead of a Cloudflare Worker, this repository uses GitHub Actions to run
usque on a runner, generate the Mihomo MASQUE subscription, and commit it to
the repository so GitHub Pages can serve it as a Clash subscription URL.

No source code was copied from the referenced projects.
